      "body": "## Purpose\n\n`.buildkite/ci_config.yaml` runs the whole pipeline when a PR touches any `run_all_patterns` file. Two entries don't need that:\n\n- **`requirements/kv_connectors.txt`** is not in the image. It is installed at test time by `.buildkite/scripts/install-kv-connectors.sh`, only in the steps that call it, and only on CUDA 13 (ROCm installs `kv_connectors_rocm.txt`, CUDA 12 `kv_connectors_cu12.txt`). Since #63609 those steps are disabled on `ci`.\n- **`.buildkite/check-torch-abi.py`** is run only by the `torch-stable-abi-audit` step, which already lists it in `source_file_dependencies`.\n\nThis drops both from `run_all_patterns`.\n\n## Test Plan\n\nWith ci-infra `main`'s generator functions on the edited config:\n\n| changed file | run all | steps picked by `source_file_dependencies` |\n|---|---|---|\n| `requirements/kv_connectors.txt` | no (was yes) | the steps that declare it |\n| `.buildkite/check-torch-abi.py` | no (was yes) | `torch-stable-abi-audit` |\n| `csrc/foo.cu`, `requirements/common.txt` | yes (unchanged) | – |\n\nThe ci-selector on a change to `check-torch-abi.py` picks `torch-stable-abi-audit` and no GPU test steps.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
